pgrade the wireless charging  speed of Max safe maybe going all the  way up to 20 watt Max safe wireless  charging with the next iPhone 15 lineup  and then on top of that apparently it  Apple September event Apple was  originally going to release a new Apple  pencil codenamed maker priced at about  49 with no pressure sensing no battery  needed using a chip to power the stylus  from the screen similar to the Samsung S  Pen and apparently Apple was going to  give this new apple pencil support for  the iPhone for the first time ever but  apparently the project was terminated  right before the launch it's even said  that they had close to 1 million levels  of stock of this new apple pencil and  they should now all apparently be  scrapped which to me doesn't make any  sense at all there's a good chance that  Apple could delay this new apple pencil  an entire year until the iPhone 15  lineup and maybe even give us apple  pencil support for the first time and  maybe even just for the pro Max model  which could end up up being called the  ultra who really knows but I can only  hope and then making it even better  according to Majin Buu there is a chance  that the new iPhone 15 Ultra or Pro Max  could support Thunderbolt 4 with up to  80 gigabits per second of bandwidth  which is absolutely insane because right  now it's limited to 40 gigabits per  second so 80 would just be crazy so I  don't know what Apple's gonna do but if  they give us that amount of bandwidth  it's going to be a massive massive  upgrade so there you guys go those were  the leaks and rumors for the 15 Pro Max  and let me know Down Below in the  comments if you're deciding to wait  until the iPhone 15 lab gets released or  just buy the new iPhone 14 pro Max maybe  even with this new Taurus awesome case  thanks for watching click the circle  about to subscribe for more videos like  this one check out one of those two  right there and we'll see you in the  next video  [Music]

